0..51 Comment "//! This source shows shared views kept in regions."
52..55 Comment "//!"
56..115 Comment "//! A kept shared view can outlive the access that lent it."
116..170 Comment "//! Its held value stays frozen until the region ends."
171..174 Comment "//!"
175..218 Comment "//! The checker orders regions by outlives."
219..271 Comment "//! It releases the held value when the region ends."
272..275 Comment "//!"
